      "id": 1,
      "text": "Pueblo’s name derives from the Spanish word “pueblo,” meaning village, a term explorers used for settlements along the Rio Grande Valley.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
